OL,3,GNEWSAMan who accidentally stabbed
OL,4,Afriend jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who accidentally stabbed his
OL,7,Ffriend while trying to intimidate a
OL,8,Fgroup of people has been jailed.
OL,10,FSafa Lawan, 23, of Russell Street in
OL,11,FPeterborough, was "wildly swinging a
OL,12,Fknife around" in Highbury Street in
OL,13,FMillfield in the city on 28 September
OL,14,Fwhen he caught his friend's shoulder,
OL,15,Fcausing a minor injury, Cambridgeshire
OL,16,FPolice said.
OL,18,FLawan pleaded guilty to affray and
OL,19,Fpossession of a knife in public.
OL,21,FHe was jailed for 22 months at
OL,22,FCambridge Crown Court on 27 October.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
